1
01:14:48,560 --> 01:14:49,920
That's normal, it was concealed.

2
01:14:50,160 --> 01:14:52,120
Anyway, it's quite a installation.

3
01:14:53,120 --> 01:14:55,720
Too bad you can't open the trunk in the same way.

4
01:14:56,640 --> 01:14:59,120
Only a specialist could open it, or else it would have to be drilled.

5
01:14:59,680 --> 01:15:02,320
Maybe that's what the bat had in mind. the bat had in mind.

6
01:15:02,680 --> 01:15:04,960
Itu mungkin. He'll try his luck again, I think.

7
01:15:06,280 --> 01:15:07,680
Warner, gone.

8
01:15:07,880 --> 01:15:09,680
- Is that right? - And we murdered Dr. Wells.

9
01:15:11,800 --> 01:15:13,960
Lieutenant Anderson, he's on the case right now.

10
01:15:14,360 --> 01:15:15,960
Is he aware of what happened here tonight?

11
01:15:16,160 --> 01:15:18,160
Yes, we've contacted him, he should be here soon.

12
01:15:30,000 --> 01:15:31,320
Where are these flames coming from?

13
01:15:33,120 --> 01:15:34,520
The garage is on fire!

14
01:15:38,280 --> 01:15:39,440
Kemana kamu pergi?

15
01:15:39,800 --> 01:15:42,000
- Notify the fire department. - No one should move from here.

16
01:15:42,400 --> 01:15:43,400
But what about the garage?

17
01:15:43,760 --> 01:15:45,720
Well, let it burn! Watch the stairs.

18
01:15:46,120 --> 01:15:48,080
This fire is just a diversion to get us out of the house.

19
01:15:49,000 --> 01:15:50,560
Get us out... You're talking about...

20
01:15:50,680 --> 01:15:52,640
But yes, it's the bat, obviously.

21
01:15:52,960 --> 01:15:57,120
Now that we've turned off the lights, he'll think we're gone and he'll come back.

22
01:15:57,600 --> 01:15:58,560
Just like the Lieutenant.

23
01:15:58,720 --> 01:16:00,280
I'm counting on that, but a little later, I'm afraid. later, I'm afraid.

24
01:16:00,640 --> 01:16:02,880
And the bat will kill us if we cross his path,

25
01:16:03,280 --> 01:16:04,880
you have to outsmart him.

26
01:17:17,120 --> 01:17:19,600
You'll be safer down there. I'll take care of him.

27
01:17:19,760 --> 01:17:21,600
Let the others go downstairs. But I'm not going anywhere.

28
01:17:22,280 --> 01:17:24,120
All right, then, then hide.

29
01:17:50,240 --> 01:17:52,240
Come on, get up ladies, and get it over with.

30
01:17:53,040 --> 01:17:55,480
Some have seen my face before I died.

31
01:17:55,600 --> 01:17:57,280
I won't give you that pleasure, I'm sorry.

32
01:17:58,160 --> 01:18:00,560
I would have liked to read this scene in one of your of your books, Ms. Van Gorder.

33
01:18:01,000 --> 01:18:02,960
Unfortunately, you will never write it!

34
01:18:07,800 --> 01:18:11,520
That monster was Warner, I knew it.

35
01:18:16,080 --> 01:18:17,400
You are mistaken, Miss Allen.

36
01:18:17,960 --> 01:18:18,960
Warner?

37
01:18:21,760 --> 01:18:24,240
I hate to be suspected of murder, Miss.

38
01:18:25,400 --> 01:18:28,720
I was on my way to the airport, but halfway through, I changed my mind.

39
01:18:28,840 --> 01:18:30,280
And I came back.

40
01:18:31,080 --> 01:18:32,640
Saya pikir saya melakukan hal yang benar.

41
01:18:46,040 --> 01:18:47,800
Ya ampun! It's Lieutenant Anderson.

42
01:18:53,920 --> 01:18:55,680
That's right, it was Anderson.

43
01:18:56,880 --> 01:19:00,200
He had discovered the secret antechamber and was apprehensive to enter it.

44
01:19:00,880 --> 01:19:03,000
In order to break into the damned safe.

45
01:19:03,960 --> 01:19:08,160
We found the stolen money, 1 million in 10, 20 and 100 dollar bills.

46
01:19:12,000 --> 01:19:13,680
That old crook Andy.

47
01:19:15,160 --> 01:19:18,840
All those thousands of dollars, diverted recycled into bearer bonds,

48
01:19:20,240 --> 01:19:22,800
This is a very bold way to hide ill-gotten gains.

49
01:19:23,200 --> 01:19:24,840
And with what aplomb!

50
01:19:25,480 --> 01:19:27,120
Always so respectable.

51
01:19:29,320 --> 01:19:30,880
But the moral of the story...

52
01:19:32,160 --> 01:19:34,640
is that even if you are full of of boldness,

53
01:19:35,880 --> 01:19:38,960
a murderer always pays.

54
01:19:47,400 --> 01:19:48,800
This is it, Dayle.

55
01:19:49,440 --> 01:19:51,160
Final point!

56
01:19:55,240 --> 01:20:01,480
